      "items": [
        "sports_run.py has its own path: execute_bets → sports_evidence (EV preflight, session clock, create_preflight) → create_order(informed=); still refused (SKIP_INFORMED) until the attestation file and a real FV source exist",
        "Dynamic cap and half-Kelly run in allocate() (step 4), before execute_allocations",
        "Maker-first routing decides HOW to place, never WHETHER; the fairer maker floor stays behind VALEDIA_MAKER_FIRST_ENFORCE (off)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Fail-open vs fail-closed",
      "items": [
        "Fail-open: strategy pause, category gate (errors allow)",
        "Fail-closed: intel vetting, maker route/EV pre-flight, clocks, informed pre-flight, create_order re-check",
        "Nimble 2 is the last gate and can only remove an order: allow iff buy, confidence ≥ 0.05 and p_cal ≥ max(0.60, break-even + 0.02 × phi); default mode is shadow (logs, never blocks)",
        "Bare POST ack is UNRECONCILED, never a live open"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Offline side",
      "items": [
        "Pause registry is written only from fee-true stats; fee-blind P&L is report-only",
        "Signal: no model text; settle ping and 11pm report share one ledger_view selection; bad, future-dated or untimed rows are flagged in every sender, never counted in one and not another",
        "backtest_gate writes nothing and has a hard min-n of 30; the weekly self-evolve lab uses it as judge and only writes proposals (refuses --live)",
        "Nimble 2 decisions log to data/systemone/decisions.jsonl; isotonic calibration feeds p_cal back after 30 scored decisions"
      ]
    }
